OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals' plea to public as flu
OL,4,Aadds to pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to use health
OL,7,Fservices carefully as hospitals in
OL,8,FSussex face "significant pressure" on
OL,9,Femergency and inpatient services, with
OL,10,Fhigh levels of flu and seasonal
OL,11,Finfections adding to demand.
OL,13,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex NHS
OL,14,FFoundation Trust said pressures were
OL,15,Fparticularly severe at the Royal Sussex
OL,16,FCounty Hospital, in Brighton, and
OL,17,FWorthing Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
