OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals' plea to public as flu
OL,4,Aadds to pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther hospitals, including St Richard's
OL,7,FHospital in Chichester and Princess
OL,8,FRoyal Hospital in Haywards Heath, were
OL,9,Falso experiencing "extremely
OL,10,Fchallenging levels of demand", with
OL,11,Fpressure on beds, it said.
OL,13,FNHS leaders said they were taking
OL,14,Furgent action and working to speed up
OL,15,Fsafe discharges and open up capacity
OL,16,Fwhere possible.
